---
import produceImg from '/src/assets/media/features/produce-export-1970s.jpg';
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="produce-heading">
  <div class="split reveal">
    <div class="split-text">
      <span class="sect-label">Produce &amp; Export</span>
      <h2 id="produce-heading">From Storyboard to <span class="grad-text">YouTube in Minutes</span></h2>
      <p>Arrange your best takes into a sequential storyboard, add background audio, trim each clip, and export your final cut &mdash; ready for YouTube, social, or client delivery.</p>
      <ul class="feat-list">
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>Scene management</strong> &mdash; organize shots into scenes. Drag to reorder. Keep your narrative structure clean.</span></li>
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>Take-level trim</strong> &mdash; trim each clip to the perfect moment before assembling your sequence.</span></li>
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>Background audio</strong> &mdash; add music or voiceover to your final cut.</span></li>
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>One-click export</strong> &mdash; download your finished video or share a preview link with your team or client.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="split-visual">
      <img src={produceImg.src}
        alt="Video production timeline and export interface" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>